        <item>
            <title>0.14.85</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 11:39:05 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>146</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.85</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Recorded screen video now shows in the in-app preview. The video was captured correctly, but it was written as a fragmented QuickTime file the embedded player couldn&#x27;t load, so the video card was hidden and it looked like nothing was recorded. New recordings are written faststart so the preview plays.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
